  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "请你看看这只蓝鸦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F60770B770B8FD953EA84DD9E26300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它拿着一条破旧的丝绸围巾，\n这围巾似乎对它非常重要。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8362FF77404E006761783465E776844E1D7EF856F45DFEFF0C000A8FD956F45DFE4F3C4E4E5BF95B83975E5E3891CD8981300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我觉得它说不定是\n在寻找围巾的主人。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189C95F975B838BF44E0D5B9A662F000A57285BFB627E56F45DFE76844E3B4EBA300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然而，线索只有这条围巾\n和上面绣着的名字，<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>斐托<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136800CFF0C7EBF7D2253EA67098FD9676156F45DFE000A548C4E0A97627EE377407684540D5B57FF0C00100002FF0000066590625800100002FF000000300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蓝嘎！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "84DD560EFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看！它刚才对斐托\n这个名字起反应了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770BFF015B83521A624D5BF965906258000A8FD94E2A540D5B578D7753CD5E944E86300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你认识的人里面，\n有没有熟悉围巾的人？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608BA48BC676844EBA91CC9762FF0C000A67096CA16709719F608956F45DFE76844EBAFF1F00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "问琵鲁",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95EE74359C810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "问玳萝",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95EE73B3841D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "围巾？\n琵鲁应该更懂吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我帮不上忙，抱歉啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56F45DFEFF1F000A74359C815E948BE566F461C25427FF1F00100001BE00000A62115E2E4E0D4E0A5FD9FF0C62B16B49554A3002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "围巾？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56F45DFEFF1F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我算是比较了解布料和材质，\n但是只有一条围巾的话，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n实在无法知道它的主人是谁。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117B97662F6BD48F834E8689E35E036599548C67508D28FF0C000A4F46662F53EA67094E00676156F45DFE76848BDDFF0C00100001BE00000A5B9E572865E06CD577E590535B8376844E3B4EBA662F8C013002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了。\n你问问亚莎美如何？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E863002000A4F6095EE95EE4E9A838E7F8E59824F55FF1F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "时尚服饰馆的亚莎美虽然很麻烦，\n但她毕竟是名专业设计师，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n对各种布料都很熟悉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65F65C1A670D9970998676844E9A838E7F8E867D71365F889EBB70E6FF0C000A4F4659796BD57ADF662F540D4E134E1A8BBE8BA15E08FF0C00100001BE00000A5BF9540479CD5E03659990FD5F88719F60893002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n相信你一定能找到围巾的主人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A76F84FE14F604E005B9A80FD627E523056F45DFE76844E3B4EBA3002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你找到解决问题的方向了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n请你找出围巾的主人吧，\n这也是为了蓝鸦好。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F60627E523089E351B395EE9898768465B954114E86300200100001BE01000A8BF74F60627E51FA56F45DFE76844E3B4EBA5427FF0C000A8FD94E5F662F4E3A4E8684DD9E26597D300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你找出围巾的主人吧，\n这也是为了蓝鸦好。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F60627E51FA56F45DFE76844E3B4EBA5427FF0C000A8FD94E5F662F4E3A4E8684DD9E26597D300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蓝嘎！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "84DD560EFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是路过的设计师，亚莎美。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F8DEF8FC776848BBE8BA15E08FF0C4E9A838E7F8E3002001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你又想打场在超级进化状态下的\n时髦的宝可梦对战了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6053C860F36253573A57288D857EA78FDB531672B660014E0B7684000A65F69AE676845B9D53EF68A65BF962184E86FF1F001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请看这条围巾",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7770B8FD9676156F45DFE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请看这条围巾",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7770B8FD9676156F45DFE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请看这条围巾",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7770B8FD9676156F45DFE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是相信我这个设计师，\n才让我做鉴定的对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F76F84FE162118FD94E2A8BBE8BA15E08FF0C000A624D8BA96211505A92745B9A76845BF95427FF1F001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这条围巾……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9676156F45DFE20262026001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它虽然脏兮兮的，\n但是从设计和布料来看，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这是伽勒尔地区宫门市的\n某个学校发给新生的围巾。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而且是3年前的东西了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83867D7136810F516E516E7684FF0C000A4F46662F4ECE8BBE8BA1548C5E0365996765770BFF0C00100001BE01000A8FD9662F4F3D52D25C145730533A5BAB95E85E027684000A67D04E2A5B66682153D17ED965B0751F768456F45DFE300200100001BE00000A800C4E14662F00335E74524D76844E1C897F4E863002001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了，你是从哪里得到这条围巾的？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86FF0C4F60662F4ECE54EA91CC5F9752308FD9676156F45DFE7684FF1F001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蓝鸦拿着的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "84DD9E2662FF774076840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它似乎在寻找围巾的主人",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834F3C4E4E57285BFB627E56F45DFE76844E3B4EBA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寻找被绣上名字的人……\n多么时髦的故事啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BFB627E88AB7EE34E0A540D5B5776844EBA20262026000A591A4E4865F69AE6768465454E8B554AFF01001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，去艾特瓦鲁学校找找看如何？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果围巾的主人在密阿雷的话，\n应该是上的艾特瓦鲁学校。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C53BB827E727974E69C815B666821627E627E770B59824F55FF1F00100001BE01000A5982679C56F45DFE76844E3B4EBA57285BC6963F96F776848BDDFF0C000A5E948BE5662F4E0A7684827E727974E69C815B6668213002001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果围巾的主人在密阿雷的话，\n应该是上的艾特瓦鲁学校。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C56F45DFE76844E3B4EBA57285BC6963F96F776848BDDFF0C000A5E948BE5662F4E0A7684827E727974E69C815B6668213002001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蓝嘎啊！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "84DD560E554AFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这只蓝鸦怎么回事？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD953EA84DD9E26600E4E4856DE4E8BFF1F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等等，你该不会是\n那时的稚山雀吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B497B49FF0C4F608BE54E0D4F1A662F000A90A365F676847A1A5C7196C05427FF1F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蓝嘎！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "84DD560EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真的假的！？\n我们可是在伽勒尔地区相遇的啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你竟然越过重洋到这里来了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F768450477684FF01FF1F000A62114EEC53EF662F57284F3D52D25C145730533A76F890477684554A300200100001BE00000A4F607ADF71368D8A8FC791CD6D0B52308FD991CC67654E865417FF1F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蓝嘎！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "84DD560EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你当时明明受伤了……\n而且还那么瘦小……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605F5365F6660E660E53D74F244E8620262026000A800C4E148FD890A34E4876265C0F2026202600100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然来找搬到密阿雷的我。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF71366765627E642C52305BC6963F96F776846211300200100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你真的太棒了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60771F7684592A68D24E86FF0100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蓝嘎！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "84DD560EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位训练家！是你帮蓝鸦\n找到我的对吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n谢谢你！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB6FF01662F4F605E2E84DD9E26000A627E5230621176845BF95417FF1F00100001BE00000A8C228C224F60FF01FF0100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以让这只蓝鸦\n当我的搭档吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE58BA98FD953EA84DD9E26000A5F5362117684642D68635417FF1F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F5371364E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
